{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the trial version page!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out the demo version of VanySlash! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version of this game is currently in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We plan to have you play the trial version and make adjustments to reflect your feedback so that it becomes a good game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the trial version, you can receive a quest from the bar at your base and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">experience one quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the final version, Vany's skills will be strengthened and added as the story progresses and she completes side quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First of all, I'd be happy if you could try it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And please leave a comment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;VanySlash&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Heroine of the Melee Wizard &quot;Vany&quot; with her Partner Axe &quot;Magnus\u2162&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Magic Devices and Fight, Sexy &amp; Hot-Blooded! It is an Action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0Order a Quest and Set out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjust Vany's Equipment at the Base's Bar and Receive Quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's Advance the Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Quest Provides Costumes and Accessories to Dress up the Vany.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get Magical Tools to Enhance their Actions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance Vany and Magnus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0Level up with Free Quests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are Free Quests that you can go Around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can try out new Outfits and Actions, and earn Experience and Money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0Various looks! Customization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The costume is divided into torso and legs, so you can combine them however you like.<br>There are five accessory slots: for the head, eyes, mouth, waist, and back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0Come On, Let's Go On an Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sexy &amp; Valor! Action RPG &quot;Vanyslash&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Vany and Magnus in their Adventures!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764910?t=1748789050","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764910/2938577f49fe42aa1ad384330f8f26c8549f65fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748789050","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764910/be21654a3b3578d621bf0f36a723b71116970e86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748789050","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764910/be21654a3b3578d621bf0f36a723b71116970e86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748789050","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not suitable for all ages or for viewing at work, including revealing costumes, sexy emotes and use of alcohol."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the trial version page!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out the demo version of VanySlash! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version of this game is currently in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We plan to have you play the trial version and make adjustments to reflect your feedback so that it becomes a good game.</p><p class=\"bb_pa